@startuml
title Issue command to result
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant GitHub
participant Receiver
database Spool
participant Worker
participant Provider
participant Deployer
User -> GitHub : Apply recognized label
GitHub -> Receiver : Signed event + delivery ID
Receiver -> Receiver : Verify signature, sender, command
Receiver -> Spool : Write delivery.json
Receiver --> GitHub : 202 queued
Worker -> Spool : Rename to .json.processing
Worker -> GitHub : Request installation token
Worker -> GitHub : Consume recorded labels
Worker -> Worker : Clone temporary workspace\nLoad default-branch config
Worker -> GitHub : Started comment
alt plan / implement
  Worker -> Provider : Prompt through stdin
  Provider --> Worker : Output + exit code
  alt implementation
    Worker -> GitHub : Push new agent branch\nCreate draft PR
  else plan
    Worker -> GitHub : Post plan
  end
else deploy-only
  Worker -> GitHub : Read linked open PR\nRead current head SHA
end
opt preview requested
  Worker -> GitHub : Read live issue/PR discussion
  Worker -> Deployer : Ref + SHA + content fingerprint
  Deployer --> Worker : deployed / unchanged + URL
  Worker -> GitHub : Preview result comment
end
Worker -> Worker : Clean temporary workspace
Worker -> Spool : Archive done / failed
note over Worker
Individual task errors are logged;
the daemon continues with other tasks.
end note
@enduml
